    "attachments" : [ {
      "content" : "Let's face it. Mixed drinks are great, and there's nothing better after a hard week of work than kicking back with a Long Island Iced Tea and a soldering iron. But a lot of bars have a strict no soldering iron policy (don't ask me why I know) and who even knows what's in a LIIT? It sure as hell doesn't come from a tea bag!\r\n\r\nThe inspiration for this project comes from the ease of use of a kegerator and the desire to effortlessly make mixed drink...",
